    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "title",
     "text": "Kosmik & Cultivators Classic Pop-Up",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "datetime",
     "text": "August 7, 2026\n@ 4:00 pm\n- 6:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/3b8b11ca-Regenerative-Logo_200px.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Regenerative-Logo_200px.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Regenerative, LLC",
     "w": 200,
     "h": 188,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Join us for the Kosmik and Cultivators Classic Pop-Up"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>to learn more about each brand, explore their selection of gummies, concentrates, vape products, and more. Ask questions about cannabinoids, terpenes, product effects, and recommended uses. Whether you’re new to these brands or already a fan, it’s a great opportunity to expand your cannabis knowledge.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "Regenerative, LLC is a Massachusetts’ premier, licensed cannabis cultivator and manufacturer, based in Uxbridge."
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>The name Regenerative stems from the pursuit of growing in true living soil also known as regenerative farming. As a result, the difference in the quality of their product cannot be understated – the combination of organic practices, sun-grown, and directly in soil is truly the way cannabis was meant to be grown.</p><p>They offer high-quality, sustainably sun-grown cannabis products, proudly cultivating in our Tier 10 outdoor facility. They have 14 active hoop houses alongside our outdoor field in full bloom, and a product manufacturing lab. They take pride in our environmentally conscious techniques, growing in true organic soil.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><img src=\"assets/source/715999fb-kosmik-cclassic-uncut-banner-e1784817619700-1024x186.jpg\" alt=\"Kosmik, CClassic and Uncut Brands\" width=\"800\" height=\"145\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/kosmik-cclassic-uncut-banner-e1784817619700-1024x186.jpg?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/cd2b7ef0-kosmik-cclassic-uncut-banner-e1784817619700.jpg\"></p><p><a href=\"/brands/kosmik-brands/\"><strong>Click here to shop Kosmik products!</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"/brands/cclassic/\"><strong>Click here to shop Cultivators Classic products!</strong></a></p>"
    },
